166
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:40,680
Do you have any leads?

167
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:49,360
Now, Buk, going by the names on my list, it looks like Chrollo's probably the strongest.

168
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:53,560
But Kurapika told me that the Chrollo here is definitely an imposter.

169
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:55,400
So who do you think it is then?

170
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:58,360
Well, probably a member of the troop.

171
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:01,800
