174
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:07,120
Well then why wouldn't they want to use their own name?

175
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,900
I have no idea.

176
00:11:08,900 --> 00:11:11,940
Try using Clairvoyance.

177
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:15,900
If this person didn't come all the way here to beat the game, they simply wouldn't bother

178
00:11:15,900 --> 00:11:16,900
